                  "text": "Mar 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya odwoko ni, “Aneno Joisiraili joywore wi gote paka rombo ma jongoye gi jakwath. Aka Rwoth owaco ni, ‘Cwo me jongoye gi jatel weyi jowodoki peco i siem.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
